OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see clear periods and the odd
OL,7,Fshower. Clear periods and occasional
OL,8,Fpassing showers for the rest of the
OL,9,Fnight. Fresh to strong west to
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA mixture of sunny spells and
OL,13,Fpassing showers. Fresh west to
OL,14,Fsouthwesterly winds, but less windy
OL,15,Fthan on Monday.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,18,Fspells and showers on Wednesday.
OL,19,FBright and mainly dry on Thursday.
OL,20,FRain spreading east on Friday.
OL,21,FBecoming somewhat colder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
